SUMMARY:Thanksgiving volunteering: deliver meals + visit older adults (Lit
 tle Brothers)
DESCRIPTION:Pick up Thanksgiving meals downtown and deliver them to older 
 adults around SF\, with the option to stay and share the visit. It's a me
 aningful way to spend the holiday when your family is far away. Register 
 ahead: the pick-up details are emailed to volunteers.\nPrice: Free (regis
 ter as a volunteer in advance)\nhttps://www.littlebrotherssf.org/holiday-
 opportunities
