 ld parrots). It covers the hill's history from Gold Rush lookouts to arti
 sts. It's steep\, so wear sturdy shoes. Rain may cancel.\nPrice: Free (do
 nations welcome)\nhttps://www.sfcityguides.org/find-your-tour/?visit=2026
 -11-28
